808" end="00:35.009">then </span><span begin="00:35.009" end="00:35.194">if </span><span begin="00:35.194" end="00:35.412">she </span><span begin="00:35.412" end="00:35.786">is </span><span begin="00:35.786" end="00:36.091">so </span><span begin="00:36.090" end="00:36.888">perfect</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:37.400" end="00:41.382"><span begin="00:37.400" end="00:37.631">Do </span><span begin="00:37.631" end="00:37.875">I </span><span begin="00:37.875" end="00:38.505">still </span><span begin="00:38.505" end="00:38.984">wish </span><span begin="00:38.984" end="00:39.221">that </span><span begin="00:39.221" end="00:39.402">it </span><span begin="00:39.402" end="00:39.679">was </span><span begin="00:39.679" end="00:41.382">you</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:42.917" end="00:45.353"><span begin="00:42.917" end="00:43.323">Perfect </span><span begin="00:43.322" end="00:43.602">don't </span><span begin="00:43.602" end="00:44.318">mean </span><span begin="00:44.318" end="00:44.522">that </span><span begin="00:44.522" end="00:44.821">it's </span><span begin="00:44.821" end="00:45.353">working</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:45.581" end="00:50.017"><span begin="00:45.581" end="00:45.880">So </span><span begin="00:45.880" end="00:46.147">what </span><span begin="00:46.147" end="00:46.404">can </span><span begin="00:46.404" end="00:46.936">I </span><span begin="00:46.936" end="00:50.017">do</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:50.515" end="00:53.797"><span begin="00:50.515" end="00:50.767">When </span><span begin="00:50.767" end="00:51.093">you're </span><span begin="00:51.093" end="00:52.258">out </span><span begin="00:52.258" end="00:53.336">of </span><span begin="00:53.336" end="00:53.797">sight</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:55.387" end="00:58.258"><span begin="00:55.387" end="00:56.524">In </span><span begin="00:56.524" end="00:57.563">my </span><span begin="00:57.563" end="00:58.259">mind</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:59.128" end="0